    <title>FH.06 音乐剧观众守序善良，戏曲观众混乱邪恶（开玩笑的！）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69496b280b60b7bf75e256d1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69496b280b60b7bf75e256d1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Dec 2025 16:10:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>这是一期戏曲、音乐剧生态的对照观察</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>必要叠甲：</span></strong><span>主播、本期嘉宾的观点是纯观众视角，主观且难免片面的，每人只为自己的言论负责，不涉及或牵涉到任何往期或未来嘉宾。若有表述不到位的地方，请大家指正。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期讨论内容</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>票价与观剧空间</span></p><span></span><p><span>不同土壤与不同观演习惯/礼仪</span></p><span></span><p><span>现场乐队/演员与乐队的临场</span></p><span></span><p><span>鼓掌叫好的冲动刻进戏曲观众DNA里</span></p><span></span><p><span>拍照录像/盗摄/版权</span></p><span></span><p><span>戏曲女演员是否过分自谦？音乐剧女演员普遍更自信</span></p><span></span><p><span>戏曲的师承与辈分/程式与框架</span></p><span></span><p><span>演员对于剧本角色的独立思考能力</span></p><span></span><p><span>观众买单VS财政买单</span></p><span></span><p><span>演出总量的多少影响太多事情了</span></p><span></span><p><span>演员的竞争模式</span></p><span></span><p><span>SD</span></p><span></span><p><span>演员与观众的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span>赠票</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐剧与越剧在受众上的相似性</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以不用“看名著的眼光”对待戏曲</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：越剧《山河恋·送信》王君安、方亚芬</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>嘉宾：小段、只只</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>主播</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3708841752" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3708841752"><span>@捣枕</span></a><span>、王玉直（</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3940779042" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3940779042"><span>@风流相国是才女</span></a><span>）</span></p>]]></description>
