    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>11排13座——2025复活季</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>倒数第二期啦</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>部分关键词</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>女将军</span></p><span></span><p><span>清朝“同人文”</span></p><span></span><p><span>（强行）大团圆结局</span></p><span></span><p><span>封建思想与女性主体性</span></p><span></span><p><span>女性情欲</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期嘉宾</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>逼迫捣枕放李敏老师照片的——小段</span></p><span></span><p><span>傅派女孩——阳光（小红书@阳光Sunshine）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴与相关信息】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a> </span><strong><span>刘兰芝</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>汉乐府、越剧《孔雀东南飞》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1133">18:53</a> </span><strong><span>杨八姐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>秦腔《杨八姐盗刀》，豫剧《杨八姐游春》</span></p><span></span><p><span>电视剧《穆桂英挂帅》苗圃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1366">22:46</a> </span><strong><span>玉芙蓉</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>新昌调腔《女吊》（《红神》）</span></p><span></span><p><span>鲁迅散文《女吊》</span></p><span></span><p><span>新昌调腔《男吊》《目连救母》</span></p><span></span><p><span>高腔、帮腔、目连号</span></p><span></span><p><span>川剧《情探》，台州乱弹《活捉三郎》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">35:25</a> </span><strong><span>孟丽君</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkYPlA4jMX0SoCk8-mN7TVUG_3iW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>陈端生《再生缘》，越剧《孟丽君》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《玉钏缘》——陈端生——梁德绳——侯芝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3074">51:14</a> </span><strong><span>蒋琴心</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>豫剧《三拂袖》</span></p><span></span><p><span>“豫剧皇后”陈素真</span></p><span></span><p><span>豫剧《花木兰》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3700">61:40</a> </span><strong><span>颜氏（颜秀）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>梨园戏《节妇吟》王仁杰编剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>越剧《断指记》移植自《节妇吟》，吴兆芬改编</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4273">71:13</a> </span><strong><span>莲花女</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>越剧《莲花女传奇》李莉编剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4870">81:10</a> </span><strong><span>一枝梅</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>梨园戏《皂隶与女贼》王仁杰编剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5208">86:48</a> </span><strong><span>片尾：越剧《孟丽君·他那里字字句句诉衷情》李敏</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播——</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3708841752" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3708841752"><span>@捣枕</span></a><span>、王玉直（</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3940779042" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3940779042"><span>@风流相国是才女</span></a><span>）</span></p>]]></description>
