    <guid isPermaLink="false">68fa6df70156720321c2cb7a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Oct 2025 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>11排13座——2025复活季</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>9-11月，每月双更（每月的第2和第4个周二，上午9点）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>复活第四期：精彩和离谱并存的海龟汤节目！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>* 海龟汤是一种解谜推理游戏，题面也称作汤面，是一段含有关键信息，但不完整的叙述，参与者根据自己的猜测不断提问，主持人只能回答“是”“不是”“是也不是”“与此无关”或“不重要”，直到（相对）完整还原出整个故事。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>有文化的文艺工作者嘉宾们</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>热爱伦理推理的鸽子妹妹，简称鸽妹</span></p><span></span><p><span>捣枕的大学舍友灰灰妹妹，简称卉妹</span></p><span></span><p><span>大栅栏蒋雯丽VC，全称我们共同的姐（</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e280fa7418a84a0461f8ff0" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e280fa7418a84a0461f8ff0"><span>午夜飞行</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/632a8155ca79f70db275b21f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/632a8155ca79f70db275b21f"><span>念念敦煌</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62d7ab6092f0689a31f5040b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62d7ab6092f0689a31f5040b"><span>遗愿清单</span></a><span>等节目的主播）</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="237">03:57</a> 《外国文学》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">07:06</a> 《抵债》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a> 《妈妈1.0》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1626">27:06</a> 《妈妈2.0》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2405">40:05</a> 《巧合》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2858">47:38</a> 《干得漂亮》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3625">60:25</a> 《早起的错》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4394">73:14</a> 《好老公》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5224">87:04</a> 《古诗急转弯》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5436">90:36</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>片尾：崔兰田豫剧《桃花庵》选段</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>——主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3708841752" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3708841752"><span>@捣枕</span></a><span>、王玉直（</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3940779042" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3940779042"><span>@风流相国是才女</span></a><span>）</span></p>]]></description>
