    <title>62 越剧俞果：演员与角色呼吸同频的时刻</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a6c97f247d51713c4e41a9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a6c97f247d51713c4e41a9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Feb 2025 03:20:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我最初认识俞果的时候是2019年，那时候我们都是某种程度上的“幼崽”。五六年慢吗？说来也快，但足够发生很多的成长。俞果、越剧、舞台、时光，以及很多真正关心戏的人，很开心我们走到这里。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期嘉宾</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>俞果</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>169.5爱听罪案播客的酷飒小徐派</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>微博</span></strong><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1766990775" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1766990775"><span>@俞大果儿</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小红书</span></strong><span>@打雷要下俞</span></p><span></span><p><span>上海越剧院国家二级演员，毕业于上海戏剧学院，工小生，承徐（玉兰）派，先后师承著名演员汪秀月、当代越剧表演艺术家钱惠丽。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主要剧目：《红楼梦》《追鱼》《西厢记》《舞台姐妹》《孟丽君·游上林》《北地王·哭祖庙》《玉簪记·偷诗·逼侄赴考》《真假驸马·花园会》等。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>画画</span></strong><span>（</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/2826032303" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/2826032303"><span>@入画菱花</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>11排13座内部知名花旦，长得也高。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>您将听到</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>《舞台姐妹》的俞果在不断“升级”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>钱惠丽老师含量很高？没办法的事！</span></p><span></span><p><span>演邢月红和演贾宝玉有什么区别？</span></p><span></span><p><span>戏里f人，戏外t人，俞果请自己劝自己：你别哭。</span></p><span></span><p><span>人物心理与表演细节，艺术观点与理想追求，她从未停留在原地，每一天都是新的大果儿。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>提及的部分剧目/演员与延伸</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>越剧《舞台姐妹》</span></p><span></span><p><span>角色：月红、春花</span></p><span></span><p><span>剧目剧情介绍：<a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/plSk-XmNPMKZyCFr3NOFcw" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/plSk-XmNPMKZyCFr3NOFcw">mp.weixin.qq.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>《舞台姐妹情》（请看《舞台姐妹》）</span></p><span></span><p><span>越剧《韩非子》</span></p><span></span><p><span>俞果为韩非子落泪实况：<a data-url="https://weibo.com/2826032303/4901636135193903" href="https://weibo.com/2826032303/4901636135193903">weibo.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>越剧《红楼梦》《西厢记》《啼笑因缘》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《戏码头·中国青衣大会》节目</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>红果果的裂墙推荐</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>刘慈欣《三体》</span></p><span></span><p><span>艾萨克·阿西莫夫《基地》</span></p><span></span><p><span>梨园戏《御碑亭》《朱买臣》曾静萍</span></p><span></span><p><span>昆曲《玉簪记》岳美缇、华文漪版</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>中插唱段：钱惠丽《韩非子·绝恋》（互联网提供）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>片尾唱段：俞果《舞台姐妹·饮恨》（青春版首演场录音，画画提供）</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>「戏曲人闲扯计划」</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>是由11排13座策划、制作的独家专栏。我们会邀请到多个剧种、岗位和方向的戏曲从业者，一起闲扯、拉瓜，话题不仅限于戏曲本身，但一定可以满足你对戏曲行业的好奇心。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>主播</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3708841752" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3708841752"><span>@捣枕</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>王玉直（</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3940779042" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3940779042"><span>@风流相国是才女 </span></a><span>）</span></p>]]></description>
